{
  "#note": "Three RTL-SDRs following ONE system (Palmetto800, RFSS 2 / Site 32). All three channels share trunking_sysname, so tk_p25 parks one receiver on the control channel and lets the other two follow simultaneous voice calls. The CC role floats: tune_voice() calls release_cc(), so any receiver may end up holding the CC. Set the 'args' serials to your real dongles (rtl_test -t / rtl_eeprom).",
  "devices": [
