  "terminal": {
    "module": "websocket_server.py",
    "terminal_type": "ws:0.0.0.0:8080",
    "http_plot_interval": 1.0,
    "#audio_ports": "Deliberately absent. An explicit audio_ports list wins outright over discovery, and cannot say which channel a port belongs to - every stream then reports channel=null and the player's source picker shows three identical 'audio_ports override' entries. Letting discovery read the channel destinations instead attributes 23458/23462/23466 to rx0/rx1/rx2 by name, which is what makes /api/stream?channel=N work. The sockaudio ports are excluded automatically.",
